    # Three animation layers, all identity at load.  Lift carries the
    # altitude, Turn carries the 120-degree launch index, and Spin carries
    # the hover.  Keeping them separate is what lets the hover be stopped on
    # a beat while the altitude is held by a different, already-finished clock.
